@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN_DE_ACCESO

### EMPLOYEES - solicitudes HTTP
# Reemplaza el token y ajusta los cuerpos JSON al modelo de la entidad.

### GET /employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET /employees/1
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### POST /employees
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Técnico",
  "document": "1000000002",
  "role": "TECHNICIAN",
  "email": "tecnico@example.com"
}

###

### PUT /employees/1
PUT {{baseUrl}}/employees/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Técnico",
  "document": "1000000002",
  "role": "TECHNICIAN",
  "email": "tecnico@example.com"
}

###

### PATCH /employees/1
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/employees/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
